   20 FOR PY%=0 TO 21   30 FOR PX%=0 TO 31   40 XZ = PX%*3.5/32-2.5   50 YZ = PY%*2/22-1   60 X = 0   70 Y = 0   80 FOR I%=0 TO 15   90 IF X*X+Y*Y > 4 THEN GOTO 160  100 XT = X*X - Y*Y + XZ  110 M = X*Y  120 Y = M+M + YZ  130 X = XT  140 NEXT I%  160 PRINT CHR(I%+33%),  170 NEXT PX%  180 PRINT CHR(13)  190 NEXT PY%END*Y  120 Y = M+M + YZ  130 X = XT  140 NEXT I